<title>USA: Input/Output chairman adds titles.</title>
<headline>Input/Output chairman adds titles.</headline>
<dateline>STAFFORD, Texas 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Input/Output Inc said on Friday that Charles Selecman, chairman of the board, has been elected to the additional responsibilities of president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>The company also said the board has accepted the resignation of Gary Owens as president, chief executive officer and director effective immediately.</p>
